{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_TASKS": "1"
  },
  "_tier1_note": [
    "Tier 1 allow rules. Operator ruling 2026-08-13: 'battery commands to Tier 1",
    "via item-27 amendment; post-merge cleandown granted for self-refusing forms",
    "only (-d, --ff-only, --prune)'.",
    "TWO STANDING CONSTRAINTS govern every addition here.",
    "(1) A Tier 1 allow rule PRE-EMPTS a Tier 2 guard ask (tested 2026-08-11).",
    "The two are alternatives, not layers, so never grant here anything the",
    "governance guard is relied on to gate. Nothing below is protected-path or",
    "state-dependent.",
    "(2) Never allow-list a command family carrying a DENY, since whether a deny",
    "is pre-empted the same way is untested and has no safe probe.",
    "REPO_MANIFEST IS DELIBERATELY NARROWED, not widened: only the --out form is",
    "granted. The bare invocation writes REPO_MANIFEST.md into the tree, which is",
    "the F6 divergence closed at CL-27, and it must keep prompting so the",
    "superseded form cannot be reached without a deliberate confirmation.",
    "GIT BRANCH -d IS LOWERCASE ONLY. -D force-deletes an unmerged branch and is",
    "NOT granted. See the open risk recorded in the PR body: whether the matcher",
    "folds case is unestablished, so the -d/-D boundary is asserted here but not",
    "yet proven."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git show:*)",
      "Bash(git blame:*)",
      "Bash(git rev-parse:*)",
      "Bash(git fetch:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git pull --ff-only:*)",
      "Bash(git branch -d:*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(pwd)",
      "Bash(pytest:*)",
      "Bash(ruff check:*)",
      "Bash(python scripts/check_docs.py:*)",
      "Bash(python scripts/rehash_sweep.py:*)",
      "Bash(python scripts/d22a_preflight.py:*)",
      "Bash(python scripts/repo_manifest.py --out D:/Downloads:*)",
      "Bash(python D:/ArcaAI-repo/arcaai/scripts/check_docs.py:*)",
      "Bash(python D:/ArcaAI-repo/arcaai/scripts/rehash_sweep.py:*)",
      "Bash(python D:/ArcaAI-repo/arcaai/scripts/d22a_preflight.py:*)",
      "Bash(python D:/ArcaAI-repo/arcaai/scripts/repo_manifest.py --out D:/Downloads:*)",
      "PowerShell(git status:*)",
      "PowerShell(git diff:*)",
      "PowerShell(git log:*)",
      "PowerShell(git show:*)",
      "PowerShell(git blame:*)",
      "PowerShell(git rev-parse:*)",
      "PowerShell(git fetch:*)",
      "PowerShell(git checkout:*)",
      "PowerShell(git switch:*)",
      "PowerShell(git pull --ff-only:*)",
      "PowerShell(git branch -d:*)",
      "PowerShell(Get-ChildItem:*)",
      "PowerShell(Get-Content:*)",
      "PowerShell(Get-Acl:*)",
      "PowerShell(Test-Path:*)",
      "PowerShell(Test-NetConnection:*)",
      "PowerShell(pytest:*)",
      "PowerShell(ruff check:*)",
      "PowerShell(python scripts/check_docs.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python scripts/rehash_sweep.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python scripts/d22a_preflight.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python scripts/repo_manifest.py --out D:/Downloads:*)",
      "PowerShell(python D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\check_docs.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\rehash_sweep.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\d22a_preflight.py:*)",
      "PowerShell(python D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\repo_manifest.py --out D:/Downloads:*)",
      "PowerShell(scripts\\lint.cmd:*)",
      "PowerShell(scripts\\test.cmd:*)",
      "PowerShell(D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\lint.cmd:*)",
      "PowerShell(D:\\ArcaAI-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\test.cmd:*)",
      "PowerShell(D:\\arcaai-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\lint.cmd:*)",
      "PowerShell(D:\\arcaai-repo\\arcaai\\scripts\\test.cmd:*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell|Edit|Write|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/governance_guard.py"],
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "Governance guard..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
